  "body": "## Summary\n- keep the now-playing HUD bound to the active round entry when playback is paused or muted\n- annotate the HUD with paused/muted state instead of clearing the current episode\n- document the desktop shell invariant for now-playing and round controls\n\n## Feature Contract\nAffected contract: `docs/feature-contracts/desktop-shell.md`.\n\nThe implementation proves the invariant by separating `roundActive` (`phase == \"playing\"`) from `activelyAdvancing` (`phase == \"playing\" \u0026\u0026 !paused`). Now-playing text, playlist toggle, previous, skip, and defer are gated by the active round, while auto-hide remains gated by active playback advancement.\n\n## Validation\n- `npm run build`\n- `cargo build --release -p shows-desktop`\n- `cargo test -p shows-desktop`",
